      "desc": "Enjoy 20 of the funniest, biggest jet blasts caught on our Maho webcam on Sint Maarten.  00:14 AA Boeing 737-823 00:30 Delta Boeing 757-232 00:49 Amerijet Boeing 767-300 01:19 Jetblue Airbus A312-231 01:35 AA Boeing 737-823 02:01 Copa Boeing 737-8V3 02:28 Delta Boeing 757-232 03:06 KLM Airbus A330-303 03:26 Jetblue Airbus A312-231 03:52 United Boeing 737-724 04:02 Arajet Boeing 737 Max 8 04:38 Delta Boeing 757-232 05:00 KLM Airbus A330-303 05:44 AA Boeing 737-823 06:27 Spirit Airbus A320-32A 07:00 Jetblue Airbus A312-231 07:22 Delta Boeing 757-232 08:02 KLM Airbus A330-303 08:32 AA Boeing 737-823 08:55 Delta Boeing 757-232 09:25 Saudia Boeing 777-300ER  Relive the Princess Juliana International Airport at Maho Beach Sint Maarten action with up to 12 hours of rewind on our live cam!  Would you like to support our channel? 🫶 *Paypal* 👉 https://paypal.me/showmecaribbeanlive *Merch Store* 👉 https://showmecaribbean-shop.fourthwall.com 👕🩴 *Supers*  👉 Click on the Dollar Sign next to the cha box to buy us Supers! 😻  Check the weather on Sint Maarten today.  🎧 Live Princess Juliana International Airport ATC: https://www.liveatc.net/search/?icao=sxm ✈️ Arrivals and departures: https://www.skyscanner.co.za/flights/arrivals-departures/sxm/st-maarten-arrivals-departures  A big thanks to Tortuga Maho for allowing us to stream our webcam from their Beach Café and for being a great support! 👉 https://tortugamaho.com  Live webcam Map by MapHeroes: https://maps.showmecaribbean.com/live-webcams  Top 5 Hotels for Plane-Spotting Enthusiasts:  1.⁠ ⁠Sonesta Maho Beach: https://bit.ly/47hMuyO 2.⁠ ⁠Maho Sonesta Ocean Point: https://bit.ly/3rRCcoP 3.⁠ ⁠The Morgan Resort Spa Village: https://bit.ly/3rXrQDW 4.⁠ ⁠Royal Islander Club Resort La Plage: https://bit.ly/3N37el6 5.⁠ ⁠Royal Islander Club Resort La Terrasse: https://bit.ly/3sVcRuR  Enjoy the world of plane spotting with our groundbreaking live webcam, showcasing the awe-inspiring landings of massive jets at Maho Beach Sint Maarten in stunning HD resolution.   A Caribbean Paradise with a Thrilling Twist  Located at the western tip of Sint Maarten, Maho Beach is a captivating blend of natural beauty and adrenaline-pumping excitement. Nestled alongside the Princess Juliana International Airport, this extraordinary beach offers an unparalleled spectacle as massive jets descend just meters above the sunbathers, creating a rush of anticipation and exhilaration. Its soft white sands, crystal-clear turquoise waters, and vibrant beachfront atmosphere make it an ideal destination for sunseekers, swimmers, and those seeking a tranquil escape.  This dual personality of Maho Beach – its thrilling aviation encounters and its serene Caribbean ambiance – is what sets it apart from other beaches. It's a place where you can witness the awe-inspiring power of modern aviation while simultaneously indulging in the tranquility of a tropical paradise. Whether you're seeking a heart-racing adventure or a moment of blissful relaxation, Maho Beach offers an unforgettable experience that will leave you breathless.  More Caribbean Webcams:  ✨ NEW LIVE WEBCAM | Great Bay Beach | Philipsburg | Sint Maarten 👉🌴💦🛳️ https://youtube.com/live/N5Mb2bjYwZo ✨ NEW LIVE 180 WEBCAM | Klein Curaçao | Mermaid Boat Trips 👉 https://bit.ly/3NlFb0D ☀️💦 ✨ NEW 4K LIVE WEBCAM | Handelskade & Brionplein | Curaçao | PTZ 👉 https://bit.ly/3RlWr6R  ✨ NEW 4K LIVE WEBCAM | Mambo Beach | Curacao |  👉 https://www.youtube.com/live/loHbMM9JfCs?si=KkZPKIlhgK0nwrnn ☀️💦  Get notified when we go live! Subscribe and hit the notification button.  Partner of Visit St Maarten  https://www.visitstmaarten.com/  #CaribbeanLiveStream #4KPTZ #mahobeach #sintmaarten #saintmartin #SXM #LiveCaribbeanView #CaribbeanTravel #LiveStreaming #ScenicViews #PTZLive #CaribbeanExperience #VirtualTravel #CaribbeanWonders #CaribbeanLandscape #LiveCameraCaribbean #planespotters #saintmartin #sintmaarten #airplane #airplanes #airplanelanding #airplanetakeoff #weather #visitstmaarten #visitstmaarten.com"
