      "desc": "For the first time in our 40+ year history, we set up a live camera inside an attic and what we captured was truly incredible.  When the Gates Wildlife team entered an attic for a routine inspection, we discovered something extraordinary: a mother raccoon who had just given birth to her babies. Rather than remove her right away, which could cause extreme stress during such a critical moment, we asked the homeowner if we could allow her to stay for five days to bond with her newborns.  Thanks to this amazing homeowner's compassion and trust in our humane philosophy, we were able to monitor the mother raccoon and her babies up close through a live attic cam, something we've never done before.  This is Part 1 of 2, where you'll see rare, never-before-seen footage of a raccoon mom caring for her babies in real time. It’s a raw, honest glimpse into the life of urban wildlife that’s rarely witnessed and even more rarely captured.  🦝 A huge thank you to the homeowner for making this moment possible. 🛠️ All work was carried out with a commitment to humane, responsible wildlife removal.  Subscribe for Part 2 and more incredible animal moments from the field!  Don't forget to like, comment, and subscribe for more wildlife adventure videos!  We GET THEM OUT and KEEP THEM OUT.   Follow our adventures on our Youtube Channel as we tackle some of the most challenging animal removal cases in the business. From raccoon families in attics to foxes under decks, our team is up for the task!  The Gates Wildlife YouTube channel is your source for information and advice on wildlife management and pest control. Follow our adventures as we share our knowledge and expertise, and take you behind the scenes of our work. With over 40 years of experience in the field, we are dedicated to providing humane and sustainable solutions to your wildlife management needs. Subscribe to our channel to stay up to date with our latest adventures and learn how to protect your property from wildlife.   Partnerships:   Reolink Camera: https://reolink.pxf.io/EEaMe9  We’ve teamed up with Reolink, the same camera brand we use for monitoring our baby boxes, which can be seen in all of our YouTube videos. Whether you’re looking to enhance your home or business security, Reolink has you covered with their top-of-the-line wireless cameras. From indoor to outdoor cameras, Reolink offers a wide range of options to suit your specific needs and preferences.   Follow Our Adventures!   Website: https://www.gateswildlifecontrol.com Youtube: https://www.youtube.com/user/gateswildlifecontrol  Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/gateswildlife/ Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/gates_wildlife Twitter: https://twitter.com/gateswildlife?lan... Tik Tok: https://www.tiktok.com/@gateswildlifecontrol?"
