    {
      "url": "https://youtu.be/ALmoKM90VuE",
      "title": "'Eggciting' Time for Jackie🦅 & Shadow🦅:1st Fluff, 1st Pancake, 1st Prey Delivery, December 2025😍",
      "year": 2025,
      "duration": 19,
      "poster": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/ALmoKM90VuE/maxresdefault.webp",
      "desc": "‘Original live video courtesy of FOBBV https://www.friendsofbigbearvalley.org/ The opinions presented on this channel do not necessarily reflect the opinions of FOBBV.’ Our beloved Bald Eagles Jackie🦅 and Shadow🦅 are entering the most exciting time of the season.😍 You will be able to see a few early signs of their nesting behavior. 1) Jackie and Shadow choose and form a new egg cup which is further from the back porch area where a few sticks fell off the nest in November . 2) Jackie pancakes for the 1st time this season - she lies down low to test and form the egg cup. 3) Jackie curls her talons - its an early sign of nesting behavior. Jackie practices it not to harm eggs or chicks. 4) Both Jackie & Shadow bring a lot of large sticks or branches to the nest and place them in the way to make a protection for chicks - a baby gate, crib is formed. 5) Jackie & Shadow bond over the Nestoration. There are beaky kisses and hugs. :-) 6) Shadow brings the 1st fluff of this season and puts it into the new egg cup. Jackie seems to like it. :-) Jackie and Shadow usually bring more fluff when chicks are about to hatch, so do not worry about the fact that there are mostly sticks in the nest at the moment. They usually bring grass, reeds or pine needles as fluff. Fluff is soft material for eggs and chicks. 7) First prey is delivered by Jackie to the nest. She eats it. While Jackie is eating her prey, Shadow comes with a stick and wants to eat the prey, too. 😁  Dates: -12-04 - -12-12 Place: Big Bear Valley, California, the USA Enjoy! 🥰  The video footage comes from the Live Cams, https://www.youtube.com/@FOBBVCAM and all the rights to this footage and the credit goes to  @FOBBVCAM   Friends of Big Bear Valley - the owners of the live cam.  The live feed is owned and operated by Friends of Big Bear Valley, a 501c3 nonprofit organization.  If you like watching Jackie and Shadow, you can support the Friends of Big Bear Valley to help them maintain the cameras & protect this eagle habitat in Big Bear Valley.  DONATE to FOBBV: https://www.friendsofbigbearvalley.org/donate/  Note: I have had a permission to use this content since February 7, 2024. If you have any questions, you can write to me, naturelover8385@gmail.com   #birds, #BaldEagle, #JackieAndShadow, #BigBearBaldEagles,  #wildlife, #BigBear, #Nestoration, #Nestoration, #BeakyKisses, #Fluff, #Sticks, #Prey, #Pancaking,"
