or Island South (Tom Hams Lighthouse) *RTB: Rooftop Bar at Mission Pacific in Oceanside  *THIS CAMERA IS RTB  Commands format:  * * To move the camera * *  !move [cam] [location/direction] [step]  examples: \"!move sie buoy21\" will point the Shelter Island camera towards buoy 21.  \"!move sie up 8\"  will move the Shelter Island camera up 8 steps  \"!move sis right 3\" will move the Shelter Island South camera right 3 steps  You can !move up, down, left, right.  i.e !move hie right 3  * * To zoom the camera * *  !push [cam] [1-25]  examples: \"!push sie 25\" will zoom IN the Shelter Island 4K camera 25 steps  !pull [cam] [1-25]  examples: \"!pull his 5\" will zoom OUT the Harbor Island South camera 5 steps   * * * Camera specific locations (!move [cam] [location]):  RTB PRESETS: *tip - If you want to see a specific location, start from a nearby preset and move up/down/left/right/push/pull from there.   From HIE:  tour (starts the tour) south: South of pier pier: Oceanside pier piersouth: Surfing area just south of the pier piernorth: Surfing area just north of the pier piercu: Close up near the lifeguard tower on the pier farpiercu:  Close up towards the west end of the pier beach: Beach south of Rooftop Bar vbg: Vandenberg SFB rocket launch direction surfing: Current fixed surfing preset wide: Wide shot  More will be added.  Enjoy!  ===  The San Diego Web Cam is 100% viewer supported.  Your stars, superchats, memberships, merchandise purchases and donations make this possible. Thank you for your Support!  --Watch the San Diego Web Cam 24/7 on:  YouTube:  www.SunDiegoLive.com  @missionpacifichotel  Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/SanDiegoWebCam Twitch: https://www.twitch.tv/sandiegowebcam Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/sandiegowebcam/  --Follow @SanDiegoWebCam on Twitter/YouTube/Facebook/Instagram  --How to support the San Diego Web Cam:  Facebook $1.99/month https://www.facebook.com/becomesupporter/235900079905310  YouTube 99 cents/month https://www.youtu