ber?  Click JOIN - only 99 cents/month to support this channel.  ---Changing the switched feed display       To change the switched feed display, use !show [cam]  All cameras can be displayed on the switched feed.  They are:  RVN - San Diego Bay East (Mike Hess Brewing) SIE - Shelter Island East (Bali Hai Restaurant) SIN - Shelter Island North (Bali Hai) HIS - Harbor Island South (Tom Ham's Restaurant) HIE - Harbor Island East (Tom Ham's Restaurant) AUTO - Resume auto rotation  i.e. \"!show hie\" will show the HIE camera in this switched feed \"!show auto\" will resume normal automatic rotation  =====  ===  The San Diego Web Cam is 100% viewer supported.  Your stars, superchats, memberships, merchandise purchases and donations make this possible. Thank you for your Support!  --Watch the San Diego Web Cam 24/7 on:  YouTube:  www.SunDiegoLive.com Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/SanDiegoWebCam Twitch: https://www.twitch.tv/sandiegowebcam Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/sandiegowebcam/ Rumble:  https://Rumble.SunDiegoLive.com X: https://x.com/SanDiegoWebCam Telegram: https://t.me/SanDiegoWebCam Kick: https://kick.com/sandiegowebcam  --Follow @SanDiegoWebCam on Twitter/YouTube/Facebook/Instagram/X  --How to support the San Diego Web Cam:  Facebook $1.99/month https://www.facebook.com/becomesupporter/235900079905310  YouTube 99 cents/month https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC88QpAaX8sdqm1fWYSjzbSQ/join  Merchandise https://bit.ly/3rBjr4M  Financial contributions (paypal): https://www.paypal.com/donate?hosted_button_id=3Z9DJYBKYTTEU  THANK YOU  San Diego WebCam San Diego Cam San Diego Live San Diego Live Cam #SanDiego #Live #camera #view #webcam #4k #SanDiegoLive #BayViews #SanDiegoHarbor #LiveWebcam #SanDiegoSunsets #NavyShips #SoCalVibes #SupportLocal #RotatingFeed #oceanside   News media: Rebroadcast for ANY reason requires a paid license - EXCEPT NBC, FOX, KPBS.  Message us on Facebook or Twitter, or email Pictures@SunDiegoLive.com.  Essentially, if you covered t