      "desc": "INDIANA JONES AND THE TEMPLE OF DOOM (1984) | Dinner Scene HD #indianajonesandthetempleofdoom #harrisonford  #stevenspielberg     Description: Indiana, Short, and Willie are invited to a fancy dinner at Pankot Palace, but the menu is not what they expected.   FULL playlist here ⬇️ https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLsktVqZMMQbah4exvQ5vWzs3CmulMksSI  ➡︎ The Film Story: Intrepid archaeologist Indiana Jones (Harrison Ford), on the trail of fortune and glory in Old Shanghai, is ricocheted into a dangerous adventure in India. With his faithful companion Short Round (Ke Huy Quan) and nightclub singer Willie Scott (Kate Capshaw), Indie goes in search of the magical Sankara stones, and uncovers an ancient evil that threatens all who come into contact with it.  Cast: Harrison Ford, Kate Capshaw, Ke Huy Quan, Amrish Puri, Roshan Seth, Roy Chiao, and Philip Stone. Written by: Willard Huyck, and Gloria Katz (screenplay); George Lucas (Story) Directed by: Steven Spielberg  © Paramount Pictures (1981)  The film was nominated for two (2) Oscars winning one for Best Special Effects.  Don't forget to subscribe at @https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCiwf7OvQmmSACt7IMRmGBPg?sub_confirmation=1  FOLLOW US  ➡️ Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/realcinemart ➡️ Twitter: https://twitter.com/cinemart_com  We ❤️ 🎥 🍿🎬 🎞  #indianajones #georgelucas #indianajones #katecapshaw #movieclip #movieclips #filmclips #filmclips #filmscenes #filmscene #films #movies #film #films"
