      "desc": "***Chronicles of the Ghostly Tribe* (2015), also known as *The Ghouls*, is a thrilling Chinese fantasy-adventure film that blends ancient mythology, military suspense, and monster-packed action into one wild ride!** 🏔️👻💥 The story begins in the 1970s when a mysterious military team led by the brave Hu Bayi ventures into the mysterious Kunlun Mountains to investigate a series of bizarre deaths and disappearances! 🎖️🔍😨 Deep inside an icy cavern, they discover an underground world filled with prehistoric creatures, ancient ghostly tribes, and a hidden civilization that defies all scientific logic! ❄️🦖🏺  As the team battles giant man-eating worms, phantom banshees, and shape-shifting beasts, they uncover a cosmic secret tied to a mythical \"Ghostly Tribe\" that has protected an extraterrestrial energy source for millennia! 🐉🌌⚡ Hu Bayi teams up with the fierce archaeologist Shirley Yang and the quirky professor Wang to decode ancient prophecies while evading both supernatural horrors and a covert government agency with sinister motives! 🧩👩‍🏫🕵️♂️ The film races from icy caves to desert ruins, with stunning CGI creatures and heart-pounding chase sequences that feel like *Indiana Jones* meets *The Descent*! 🏃‍♂️💨🎬  But at its core, this is a story about confronting the unknown—whether it's mythical monsters, human greed, or the ghosts of the past—and finding courage in the face of absolute terror! 💀❤️🌟 With a mix of wry humor, nostalgic Cold War-era style, and epic monster battles, *Chronicles of the Ghostly Tribe* is a tribute to classic adventure serials and a must-watch for anyone who loves mysteries buried deep beneath the earth! 🗺️🔦🎉  **Ready to dig into a world where legends are real, mountains hide nightmares, and every step deeper could be your last? Let the expedition begin!** ⛏️🌄😱"
