      "poster": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mSuYwxm8xOk/maxresdefault.jpg",
      "desc": "Thailand held a solemn and historic transfer procession for Her Majesty Queen Sirikit, the Queen Mother, whose royal remains were moved from the hospital to the Grand Palace. The 10-kilometer procession, spanning much of central Bangkok, saw thousands of citizens dressed in black lining the streets to pay their respects. Monks chanted prayers, while members of the Royal Guards escorted the cortege with traditional music and ceremonial rites. Queen Sirikit, revered as the Mother of the Nation, was known for her lifelong dedication to Thai culture, rural development, and humanitarian causes. The transfer marks the beginning of a series of royal funeral ceremonies that will continue over the coming weeks.   #live #thailand #queensirikit           The Indian Express covers a wide spectrum of national and international news, including daily updates, political developments, election coverage, gadget and mobile reviews, technology updates, entertainment news, Bollywood trends, sports news and public opinions on daily topics.  The Indian Express's comprehensive coverage extends to global events, providing insightful analysis on international affairs. With a focus on both Indian and global perspectives, the Indian Express delivers top-notch editorial analysis and in-depth reporting. Stay informed with the latest news, trends, explained and expert views from India and around the world.  You can search us on YouTube by: @indianexpress, indian express, indian express newspaper today,indian express newspaper,indian express editorial analysis,indian express analysis,indian express analysis today,indian express,indian express news,the indian express newspaper analysis,the indian express,the indian express newspaper analysis today,the indian express editorial analysis,the indian express newspaper.  Stay Tuned To Indian Express For More Updates: https://indianexpress.com/  Watch Out Our Weekly Shows: 🡆 Political Pulse - https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLrDg7LoYgk9yW