      "year": 2025,
      "duration": 0,
      "poster": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ouWBQoVFegI/maxresdefault.jpg",
      "desc": "The nest at the North East Florida Eagle Cam (NEFL) is home to bald eagle Gabrielle and Beau.  To learn more or if you have specific questions visit these links: NEFL info: https://nefleaglecam.org/ Nest Cam photo albums: https://www.flickr.com/photos/94664847@N07/albums/72177720328872292/ NEFL Event Log: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1NV90-NY2Llv6Q6yKL9ntBBOdyRxRHKLMY_QZwu-RXoQ/edit?gid=804820305#gid=804820305 Gabrielle and Beau Comparison: https://nefleaglecam.org/wp-content/uploads//10/ID-Comparison-of-Gabrielle-and-Beau.pdf Website: https://www.eagles.org/  To learn more about bald eagles, please visit - https://eagles.org/what-we-do/educate/learn-about-eagles/bald-eagle-biology/ Gabrielle and Beau timeline: https://nefleaglecam.org/gabrielle-and-beau-timeline/ Samson and Gabrielle timeline: https://nefleaglecam.org/samson-and-gabrielle-timeline-2019-2020/ AEF Newsletter (with nest info): https://www.eagles.org/flight-path-sign-up/ RULES: 1. We ask all chat guests to be respectful, polite, and focused on eagles. 2. First and foremost, the AEF Northeast Florida YT Chat Room is a family and classroom friendly place and we ask that all chat guests respect the diversity of the room. Profanity, personal invective, or other inappropriate comments will not be tolerated. Disagreements might be unavoidable but should remain polite, and they should never become arguments. Chatting is a privilege, not a right. AEF reserves the right to permanently ban chat abusers without explanation, if your presence is disruptive or inappropriate. 3. We request that guests refrain from touching on politics, religion, sports, TV shows, personal medical issues, and other unrelated topics. Although we respect your political views, please do not post them in the main chat, since this is not a forum for political issues. 4. While we appreciate the knowledge chatters have gained through various cam observations and your right to disagree with our assessments, we (AEF) trust in our volunteers to relay the most accurate information pertinent to this nest. Our volunteers, both remote and on the ground have 10 plus years experience and have focused on the development of the NEFL nest. Those that disagree are welcome to do so but what you cannot do is create a toxic chat that is focused on proving AEF and its volunteers wrong, or making those that agree with us feel bullied or unwelcomed simply for the sake of being right. 5. Our cam volunteers are 100% invested in this nest and this project. They work directly with our in-house eagle specialist/camera coordinator, in-house avian veterinarian, and rehabilitation manager to ensure that accurate biological information is given to our guests. We kindly ask that chat guests respect the volunteers who are here to make sure all viewers have a good experience. 6. We prefer that chatters focus on the Northeast Florida eagles featured on this page. We are aware that many of our chatters view other nests and like to share the news (eaglet hatchings, etc.), which is acceptable. However, please keep information from other nests to a minimum so we don’t confuse other chatters.   Subscribe to our channel to get notifications when new videos are posted. for more LIVE bald eagle nest cams; and join the conversation on these platforms:  Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/AmericanEagleFoundation Twitter: https://twitter.com/AEFeagles Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/AEFeagles/ TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@aefeagles?lang=en Reddit: https://www.reddit.com/user/aefeagles/ Linkedin: https://www.linkedin.com/company/american-eagle-foundation/ ©2023 American Eagle Foundation"
