      "poster": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Qk0fNl1FD6g/maxresdefault.jpg",
      "desc": "Full unedited watchalong reaction: https://www.patreon.com/posts/full-watchalong-142924162  After some time away, I finally watched Indiana Jones and the Last Crusade, and this ended up being my favorite of the original trilogy! The humor, the adventure, the father–son dynamic, it was just SO FUN! And so many explosions! everything just clicked for me. I totally get why so many people love this one.  Now I need your help: 👉 Should I continue and watch the two newer Indy movies too? Let me know in the comments!  If you enjoyed the reaction, please don’t forget to like and subscribe. It really helps the channel. Thanks for watching! 💛  Find me on Instagram: http://instagram.com/CristyReacts  #IndianaJones #SeanConnery #HarrisonFord"
