      "poster": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/RDTKL_hQgCw/maxresdefault.jpg",
      "desc": "Running down this this was way more terrifying than it looked and I’m not quite sure how River Phoenix made it look so easy in Indiana Jones and the Last Crusade. It’s FAR steeper than it seems.   I missed the first two lines “Mr. Havelock! Anybody!” Because I was too concentrated on not slipping.   Coming here to Moab, Utah my goal was to visit all the filming locations from The Last Crusade that were filmed here and recreate this scene. What is cool is that the two holes you see at the top there that represent a “cave” he goes into in the movie is actually just two hollowed out areas that don’t go far.   Incredible to actually see in person though. You can find this location as well as all the other locations nearby in Arches National Park!  A whole lot more to come!   #indianajones  #indianajonesandthelastcrusade  #filmlocation  #filmlocations  #filminglocations  #harrisonford"
