      "url": "https://youtu.be/u6y-Ia4n4HY",
      "title": "Small Village Life in Rural Thailand - This is how the LOCALS live 🇹🇭",
      "year": 2024,
      "duration": 47,
      "poster": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/u6y-Ia4n4HY/maxresdefault.jpg",
      "desc": "Today we went back to my village, the place I truly call home, where I was born and raised! It still warms my heart every time I return that everyone is always so welcoming and friendly - they remember lots of little details about me and my childhood and it's really nostalgic for me.  I've never forgotten where I came from and I never will, my village is a real community where everyone helps everyone and I love spending time there. It's a privilege for me to be able to show my wife and children and for them to enjoy it just as much as me! There's a real sense of freedom in \"Thai village life\" and what more could you want than the feeling of being free?  If you enjoyed this video please give it a like and leave a comment. Subscribe if you haven't already and we'll see you on the next one! 🙏  Become a member - https://www.youtube.com/@NativeFarang/join Buy us a coffee - https://www.buymeacoffee.com/nativefarang  Support directly via PayPal - https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/nativefarang?country.x=GB&locale.x=en_GB   #thailand #travel #vlog #rurallife"
