    {
      "url": "https://youtu.be/Uc-7Fn1uU2g",
      "title": "INDIANA JONES AND THE DIAL OF DESTINY | 4K | AMBIENT MOVIE | FULL IMMERSION",
      "year": 2024,
      "duration": 121,
      "poster": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Uc-7Fn1uU2g/maxresdefault.jpg",
      "desc": "🔴  Slow down time and enjoy a complete 2-hour ambient journey through the environments of INDIANA JONES AND THE DIAL OF DESTINY. Enjoy the atmosphere, sounds, and musical excerpts and feel transported into a deep meditative experience that lets us breathe inside the world of Indiana Jones.  CHAPTERS 00:00 Intro 03:46 Nazi Fortress 06:20 Escape and Chase 08:06 Fight on the Train 14:16 The Bridge in the Morning 21:14 A Lonely New York City 27:58 Drinks at the Bar 31:56 The Mystery of the Dial 33:36 Blood on His Hands & Parade Chase 36:12 The Airport and Sallah 37:39 Hotel L'Atlantique 41:46 Tuk Tuk Chase 47:15 Stormy Night on the Boat 56:53 The Underwater Sequence 1:06:15 Indy’s Getaway 1:09:45 Entrance to the Archaelogical Site 1:19:04 Inside the Cave 1:25:00 The Rope Bridge 1:34:58 Bugs! 1:37:07 The Dial of Destiny & Gunfight 1:39:30 Syracuse 1:57:24 Outro  My favorite movie of all-time is RAIDERS OF THE LOST ARK. In \"Dial of Destiny\" we are treated to an opening sequence depicting Indy in his prime. I wanted to accentuate the thrilling music and the ominous sense of danger here along with a dark and moody atmosphere.  In New York, we see a different side of Indy that we are not familiar with. Here, he is at his loneliest and I thought the ambience should be reflective of that. A city filled with people feels quite empty and sad for our long lost hero. But Helena brings with her a bright spot, and a change of fortune for Indy.  Morocco restores Indy to his former glory, doing what he does best - getting into trouble. Here, we get a street-level view of the scenery surrounding the action.  Onto Athens and Sicily where Indy really gets cooking and is in his element. At the archaeological site where Indy discovers Archimedes and the Dial, I wanted to bring in a TEMPLE OF DOOM sense of foreboding inside the dark caves and crevices.   The finale brings in a sense of calm and wonder, ending our journey wondering what fate will befall our hero. And to find out, you have to watch the actual movie!  I am a huge fan of INDIANA JONES and hope this homage to the final installment of the series brings you great joy and inspiration. Enjoy! - Jeremy  🟢  Subscribe to Ambient Freeze  ► https://www.youtube.com/@AmbientFreeze  🔵  SOCIAL MEDIA:  Twitter / X: https://twitter.com/AmbientFreeze  Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/ambientfreeze Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/ambientfreeze/  🟣 Thanks for Liking, Subscribing, and Clicking the Notification Bell 🔔 and have a great day!  Created by Jeremy  #indianajones #indianajonesandthedialofdestiny #harrisonford"
    },
