      "url": "https://youtu.be/V4FbKnMdg8s",
      "title": "The Two INSANE Movies That Almost Became Indiana Jones and The Last Crusade",
      "year": 2025,
      "duration": 8,
      "poster": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/V4FbKnMdg8s/maxresdefault.webp",
      "desc": "Welcome to Screenplay or Bust, your one-stop shop for all things movies. In today’s video, we’ll discuss the two lost/unmade Indiana Jones movies that almost became The Last Crusade. As we cover the aftermath of Indiana Jones and the Temple of Doom, the backlash it received will explain how it directly impacted George Lucas and Steven Spielberg and their development of a 3rd Indiana Jones movie. The first iteration of this 3rd movie was rumored to be titled Indiana Jones and the Castle of Blood, written by Diane Thomas(Romancing the Stone). Unfortunately, Spielberg’s hesitancy to re-engage with the horror genre after Poltergeist and Thomas’ untimely passing in 1985 caused the movie to be shelved. This led to Chris Columbus’(Gremlins, The Goonies, etc.) Indiana Jones and the Monkey King, which we will discuss in great detail. And, as a bonus, we’ll address George Lucas’ attempt to bring dinosaurs into the world of Indiana Jones. All this and more in this week’s video, as we cover the two insane movies that almost became Indiana Jones and The Last Crusade.   Copyright Disclaimer under Section 107 of the Copyright Act of 1976: This video contains brief excerpts of copyrighted film and photos for the direct purpose of education, commentary, and critical research analysis. All copyrighted material is the sole property of the original copyright owner.  Video Timestamps: 0:00 Introduction 0:30 Trial & Error:  Indy 3 1:18 Indiana Jones and the Castle of Blood 2:14 The Lost World 3:09 Indiana Jones and the Monkey King 6:22 Reduce, Reuse, Recycle 6:45 Final Thoughts  #indianajones #stevenspielberg #georgelucas #harrisonford #behindthescenes #lostmedia #indianajonesandthegreatcircle #indianajonesandthetempleofdoom #indianajonesandthelastcrusade #indianajonesandthedialofdestiny #indianajonesandthekingdomofthecrystalskull"
