      "desc": "Follow COBY CONNELL on INSTAGRAM https://www.instagram.com/cobyconnell/ Support COBY CONNELL on PATREON https://www.patreon.com/CobyConnell  Indiana Jones and the Dial of Destiny ()  Indiana Jones and the Dial of Destiny is a  American action adventure film directed by James Mangold, who co-wrote it with David Koepp and the writing team of Jez and John-Henry Butterworth. It is the fifth and final installment in the Indiana Jones film series and the sequel to Indiana Jones and the Kingdom of the Crystal Skull (2008). It stars Harrison Ford, John Rhys-Davies, and Karen Allen reprising their roles as Indiana Jones, Sallah, and Marion Ravenwood, respectively, while new cast members include Phoebe Waller-Bridge, Antonio Banderas, Toby Jones, Boyd Holbrook, Ethann Isidore, and Mads Mikkelsen. Set in 1969, the film follows Indy and his estranged goddaughter, Helena, who are trying to locate a powerful artifact before Dr. Jürgen Voller, a Nazi-turned-NASA scientist, who plans to use it to alter the outcome of World War II.  Hello everyone, welcome to Popcorn Roulette! This NEW REACTION CHANNEL is going to have a lot of different reactors popping in and out for reactions so that we are able to react to every great trailer, and all your favorite movies and tv shows! Thank you for supporting us and we hope you have a good time here!  For More Exclusive Content On Movies and TV Shows, and To Support Our Channel, Please Subscribe To Our Patreon at: https://www.patreon.com/PopcornRoulette  Social Media:  Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/popcornroulettereactions/ Twitter: https://twitter.com/p0pc0rnr0ulette  #IndianaJones #Reaction   End Music by: Diego A. R. Delfino For business inquiries, product placements, and sponsorship collaborations, please contact us at info@popcornroulette.com."
